    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/6341630a78f9d7d060a93f132f1bfd5d.poster.avif?t=1744104640\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/6341630a78f9d7d060a93f132f1bfd5d.webm?t=1744104640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/6341630a78f9d7d060a93f132f1bfd5d.mp4?t=1744104640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fully Animated and Fully Voiced Light Novel Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Tokyo, a lonely android girl, Rin, meets Aoi and forms a deep friendship, gradually reclaiming her humanity. However, when Rin learns the secret of her origins, the story takes a dramatic turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/197ea6ac7d3c941963ee7fa1be54ec29.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Story Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tokyo Girls Chronicle&quot;</i> is a story about two girls who meet and form a deep friendship in the city of Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a cold, rainy day in Tokyo, an android girl named Rin sits alone in a park, feeling a sense of solitude. With no emotions or memories, she longs for a connection with someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, a black-haired girl named Aoi appears, gently speaking to Rin and inviting her under her umbrella. As they gradually grow closer, Aoi accepts Rin for who she is and understands her loneliness. When the rain stops and a rainbow appears, Rin experiences emotions for the first time and realizes that meeting Aoi marks the beginning of a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their bond deepens, Rin slowly regains her humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, when Rin discovers the truth about her origins, the story takes a dramatic turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/86b0d974942ec143679d30c4e5c1fe5b.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspiration Behind the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until now, I hadn't been particularly interested in light novel games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was because most of them consisted mainly of text and still images, resembling a picture book, which didn\u2019t appeal to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I asked myself\u2014what if I were to create a light novel game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought that if it were fully animated, it might capture my interest. And if I could actually create it myself, it could be a truly exciting project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to keep the story simple, focusing on the bond between two girls. I chose Tokyo as the setting because I once lived there and have a deep admiration for the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/449622ba628734596b967d775b33262c.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration Feature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the story, players can enjoy an exploration game where Aoi searches for Rin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the hints within the visuals to find Rin and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/f54b9792e604f384ec79e21da6e3785a.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>Opening</strong> button to watch the opening movie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the movie ends, press the <strong>Return to Title Screen</strong> button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The button for the next chapter will appear, allowing you to continue the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/ea20761aba2b8473d56319128825cfca.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming of this game is permitted up to the chapter <i>&quot;Emily\u2019s Story.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that point, streaming is prohibited to prevent spoilers.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/6341630a78f9d7d060a93f132f1bfd5d.poster.avif?t=1744104640\" width=600 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/6341630a78f9d7d060a93f132f1bfd5d.webm?t=1744104640\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/6341630a78f9d7d060a93f132f1bfd5d.mp4?t=1744104640\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Fully Animated and Fully Voiced Light Novel Game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in Tokyo, a lonely android girl, Rin, meets Aoi and forms a deep friendship, gradually reclaiming her humanity. However, when Rin learns the secret of her origins, the story takes a dramatic turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/197ea6ac7d3c941963ee7fa1be54ec29.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Story Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Tokyo Girls Chronicle&quot;</i> is a story about two girls who meet and form a deep friendship in the city of Tokyo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a cold, rainy day in Tokyo, an android girl named Rin sits alone in a park, feeling a sense of solitude. With no emotions or memories, she longs for a connection with someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then, a black-haired girl named Aoi appears, gently speaking to Rin and inviting her under her umbrella. As they gradually grow closer, Aoi accepts Rin for who she is and understands her loneliness. When the rain stops and a rainbow appears, Rin experiences emotions for the first time and realizes that meeting Aoi marks the beginning of a new life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As their bond deepens, Rin slowly regains her humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, when Rin discovers the truth about her origins, the story takes a dramatic turn.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/86b0d974942ec143679d30c4e5c1fe5b.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Inspiration Behind the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until now, I hadn't been particularly interested in light novel games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was because most of them consisted mainly of text and still images, resembling a picture book, which didn\u2019t appeal to me.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, I asked myself\u2014what if I were to create a light novel game?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I thought that if it were fully animated, it might capture my interest. And if I could actually create it myself, it could be a truly exciting project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I wanted to keep the story simple, focusing on the bond between two girls. I chose Tokyo as the setting because I once lived there and have a deep admiration for the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/449622ba628734596b967d775b33262c.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exploration Feature</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the middle of the story, players can enjoy an exploration game where Aoi searches for Rin.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the hints within the visuals to find Rin and progress through the story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/f54b9792e604f384ec79e21da6e3785a.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=458 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the <strong>Opening</strong> button to watch the opening movie.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the movie ends, press the <strong>Return to Title Screen</strong> button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The button for the next chapter will appear, allowing you to continue the story.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3245970/extras/ea20761aba2b8473d56319128825cfca.avif?t=1744104640\" data-has-big width=800 height=444 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Guidelines for Streaming</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streaming of this game is permitted up to the chapter <i>&quot;Emily\u2019s Story.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond that point, streaming is prohibited to prevent spoilers.</p>",
